AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill requires school employees to respond honestly and completely to written requests by
parents regarding information relating to their children and provides that the district may adopt
procedures to withhold such information if a reasonably prudent person would believe that such
disclosurewouldresultinabuse,abandonmentorneglect.

